{
  "_comment": "VALIDATE-ONLY test of the best model on LOCATA STATIC tasks (task1 single + task2 multi-static), em32->3rd-order ACN/SN3D ambiX. Time-aware per-window labels are auto-detected from the manifest's 'sources' tracks (label_mode=auto); empty (count=0) windows are skipped since the model never saw count=0. DOA labels carry ~9-10 deg frame uncertainty from the empirical em32<->OptiTrack calibration (R_cal), so angular errors below ~10 deg are not distinguishable from label-frame noise. Arch mirrors the 2026_10_13 real fine-tune checkpoint. finetune_from MUST be the EMA weights (the reported 5.44 deg val was EMA); extract models/2026_10_13/best_ema_model.pth from the .ckpt first, or swap to the ready models/2026_10_01/best_ema_model.pth (synthetic base) for a baseline. Run: python lightning/train_lightning.py --config config_lightning_locata_static.json --validate-only",
